   * @x-autobe-specification Create a new refund request in the shopping_mall_refund_requests table.
   *
   * 1. Validate that the customer is the owner of the order item
   * 2. Verify the order item has status "shipped" or "delivered"
   * 3. Check the order item hasn't already been refunded
   * 4. Create a new refund request record with:
   *    - shopping_mall_order_item_id from path parameter
   *    - shopping_mall_customer_id from authenticated user context
   *    - shopping_mall_seller_id from the order item's seller
